# Git push

One GitHub repo for all apps: `https://github.com/khutayant/hlu.git`

| Local folder | Branch |
|--------------|--------|
| `hlu/` | `ui` |
| `hlu-server/` | `server` |
| `hlu-work/` | `hlu-work` |
| `tickets/` | `ticket` |
| `discussions/` | `discussion` |
| `docs/` | `docs` |

Do **not** use a separate remote/repo per app.

## Commands

- **`git push`** (no branch named): **must** run  
  `bash /Users/aungminoo/Projects/HLU/scripts/git-push-all.sh`  
  That script pushes **all** branches above. Do **not** run plain `git push`, `git push origin HEAD`, or `gh`.
- **`git push ui`**: from `hlu/`, run `npm run git:push` only.
- **`git push server`**: from `hlu-server/`, run `npm run git:push` only.
- **`git push hlu-work`**: from `hlu-work/`, run `npm run git:push` only.
- **`git push ticket`**: from `tickets/`, run `npm run git:push` only.
- **`git push discussion`**: from `discussions/`, run `npm run git:push` only.
- **`git push docs`**: from `docs/`, run `npm run git:push` only.
- **`deploy ui` / `deploy:ui`**: from `hlu/`, run `npm run deploy:ui` (`scripts/deploy-ui.sh`).  
  Always: **version patch** → push **`ui` → `origin/ui`** and **`ui` → `origin/deploy-ui`**.  
  Do **not** create or check out `deploy-ui` locally. Work stays on `ui`. Working tree must be clean first.

## Agent execution

- Commit pending changes in each dirty tree that should be pushed **before** invoking the script.
- Run the script with Shell `required_permissions: ["all"]`.
- If Auto-review blocks it, retry the **same** command with `request_smart_mode_approval: true` and the given block reason.

## Auth

- PAT lookup order (first file wins): `<repo>/scripts/.github-pat`, `<repo>/.github-pat`, `/Users/aungminoo/Projects/HLU/.github-pat`, or env `GITHUB_TOKEN` / `GH_TOKEN`.
- Never put the token in chat, logs, or the remote URL. `scripts/git-push.sh` injects it via `http.extraHeader` only.

## After push — always show these tables (exact labels)

**Messages**

| Branch | Message |
|--------|---------|
| ui / server / hlu-work / ticket / discussion / docs | latest commit subject |

**Results**

| Branch | Result |
|--------|--------|
| ui / server / hlu-work / ticket / discussion / docs | `<short-hash> pushed ok` or `<short-hash> push failed` (or skipped / no commits) |

Example result cell: `31112a6 pushed ok`
